## 2026-11-20 -- US-001: Detect a Tiiny run and read the tiiny provider config

New module src/tiiny.ts with three pure helpers:
- isTiinyRun(provider, modelIds) -- true when provider is "pi" and
  any model id starts with "tiiny/"
- deviceModelIds(modelIds) -- returns distinct ids with the tiiny/
  prefix stripped
- loadTiinyProvider(modelsFile?) -- reads the tiiny provider from
  ~/.pi/agent/models.json (or PI_MODELS_FILE), resolves $VAR apiKey
  from env, returns { provider } or { error } (error always names
  the file, never the resolved key)

Added to: build-esm second esbuild call, TESTS in scripts/test.sh,
AGENTS.md project structure and module boundaries.

28 pure tests in test/tiiny.test.ts covering detection, id stripping,
provider loading, env var resolution, error paths.

No new dependencies. No imports from orchestrator.ts.
